<title>UK: Dated Brent trades twice at Aug +17 cts - trade.</title>
<headline>Dated Brent trades twice at Aug +17 cts - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two wet Brent cargoes traded on Friday morning at August Brent +17 cents, steady on Thursday's traded level.</p>
<p>A cargo loading August 6-8 was sold by a European major to a French refiner which itself sold an August 6-8 loader to a U.S. refiner.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
</text>
